  data: {
    LLM: 'Avoid drawing too many tiles early on, as it increases your potential penalty if someone else goes out. However, a large hand can also give you more options for matching ends.\n\nIf the boneyard is nearly empty, try to block the board to force your opponent to take the remaining tiles into their hand.\n\nBoneyard Counting: Track how many tiles of each number have likely been drawn. If the board shows many 5s and you have none, expect to draw heavily if an end stays 5.',
    Player: 'Avoid drawing too many tiles early on, as it increases your potential penalty if someone else goes out. However, a large hand can also give you more options for matching ends.\n\nIf the boneyard is nearly empty, try to block the board to force your opponent to take the remaining tiles into their hand.\n\nBoneyard Counting: Track how many tiles of each number have likely been drawn. If the board shows many 5s and you have none, expect to draw heavily if an end stays 5.',
